domain SemanticSchemaLocalVerification:
  description "Verify source correction and bounded dependency re-review; not a paid retry."
evidence E_ROOT:
  "semantic-schema-root-correction-2026-09-10.think records audited true-recursion projection fault, feature-local known-invariant handling, separate V3 target aliases, and the two development typecheck corrections. Every adopted causal decision was CLI-audited with zero fatal/error/warning."
evidence E_TEST:
  "Final npm test passed 768 tests: shared339 backend401 frontend20 deployment3 release5. All typechecks and full build passed. jscpd and Lizard1.23.0 passed unchanged thresholds:209files3488functions, CC117/121 max87/92 excess1311/1369, length67/67 max707/733 excess6981/7390, args5/5 max11/11 excess10/10. Existing Vite chunk warning remains."
evidence E_EQUIVALENCE:
  "A regression reproduces the retained actual rejected schema exactly. Changing only the generic-JSON definition to additionalProperties:true removes cycles and preserves all other schema content. Shared parser retains 80 nested object/array levels and rejects non-JSON. Independent Python jsonschema4.10.3 Draft7 accepts11 varied old/new samples and rejects missing value in both. V3 normalization changes only five aliases, preserves defaults and input identity, and the retained baseline validates against normalized V3."
evidence E_BOUNDARIES:
  "Ordinary xAI adapter and probe reject cycles before fetch; non-xAI recursion remains allowed. Existing authoring formats and all three perception formats pass. Local migration fixtures validate both response and target schemas through generation/review/repair. B4 pending requests remain non-resendable. No live request, production data change, activation, commit or push was performed."
evidence E_SEAL:
  "Old Seal impact and source/status inspection identify73 in-scope refs including changed sources. Existing operation guide requires individual dependency review, explicit new-target previous-old assertions and immutable historical content. Per-ref reviews distinguish nine changed sources from compatible unchanged code/plans and historical evidence/authority. Some impact captures were after code edits but before any reseal, not wholly pre-edit. Path enumeration hit100 on a few dense paths; help states truncation does not omit membership."
premise LIMITS:
  "Equivalent standard JSON Schema and zero cycles do not establish acceptance of the revised grammar by xAI or semantic quality. No new provider run is approved. Historical probe v1 and its approval remain consumed; v2 prompt and current code cannot inherit proof a724ae39. Seal re-review cannot transform an old observation into a new execution."
decision LOCAL based_on E_ROOT, E_TEST, E_EQUIVALENCE, E_BOUNDARIES, LIMITS:
  "C-SCHEMA-004 high confidence local source correction and recurrence detection are verified separately. The true-recursion producer now emits equivalent nonrecursive grammar for v2; shared aliases are corrected from concrete types. Tests demonstrate detection at boundaries and continued local behavior. Do not conclude real-provider or production restoration."
decision SEAL based_on LOCAL, E_SEAL, LIMITS:
  "Record the explicit73-row review manifest. Register audited reasoning, shared projection helpers and tests plus evaluation-client boundary. For each named reviewed existing ref, refresh changed source bytes only when authorized; otherwise preserve exact old content. Re-review only mapped direct dependencies with explicit previous-old assertions and individual messages. Historical refs receive continued-interpretation provenance, never current-execution approval; old immutable Seals and artifact bytes stay intact. Do not automatically relink unknown refs or fabricate zero stale. Stop and disclose any unexplained dependency or contradiction. Read back status, source comparisons, stale and fsck."
decision HANDOFF based_on LOCAL, SEAL, LIMITS:
  "Record final readback separately, append current continuation with local result and exact new-run boundary, preserve B6 and deployment gates, and report local completion with live acceptance/quality unknown. Do not add global prevention rules or use workday-stop for this task."
